{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your journey begins on foreboding grounds above ancient, mysterious ruins. Driven by an insatiable thirst for glory, power, and untold riches, you will face challenges and uncover dark secrets as you pursue your damned ambitions.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a party with up to four other friends, or brave the darkness alone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dangerous Dungeons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into forgotten dungeons teeming with nightmarish creatures, deadly traps, unstable structures, hidden drops, and toxic gasses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/79f51cd1b277171c703399e3bebe302d.poster.avif?t=1763723891\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/79f51cd1b277171c703399e3bebe302d.webm?t=1763723891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Permanent Death</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death means losing your character and everything they carry, permanently. If you want to return out alive with your hard-earned loot\u2014be careful and deliberate. Anything stored in your base camp is safe.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/50beb2d0b2d067fa847b6486e76c1396.poster.avif?t=1763723891\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/50beb2d0b2d067fa847b6486e76c1396.webm?t=1763723891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble weapons from individual components: swords, maces, axes, polearms, spears, bows, or crossbows\u2014the choice is yours. Customize all gear with materials, tints, and liveries to perfectly suit your playstyle and sense of fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/7b885a5a0fa310bb3d7b07015a774b7b.poster.avif?t=1763723891\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/7b885a5a0fa310bb3d7b07015a774b7b.webm?t=1763723891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forbidden Magic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast aside piety and reach beyond the Empyrean to make deals with dark gods in exchange for forbidden power, but remember\u2014everything comes at a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/cb3db987c8b5be451d597b5c8a328197.poster.avif?t=1763723891\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/cb3db987c8b5be451d597b5c8a328197.webm?t=1763723891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Base</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return with resources from the depths to repair and upgrade your base of operations\u2014exploit upgrades to assist with your next venture for more riches and antediluvian knowledge.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3126410?t=1763723891","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763723891","capsule_image":"https://shared.akama